<title>USA: Stifel unaware of reason for share activity.</title>
<headline>Stifel unaware of reason for share activity.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stifel Financial Corp President Gregory Taylor said in a statement Friday he was unaware of any reason for the trading volume increase and price increases in the company's stock.</p>
<p>The company said composite trading volume on Wednesday was 2,900 and the stock closed at 8-1/8. On Thursday trading volume was 17,500 shares and the shares closed at 9.</p>
<p>The company's shares closed up 1 at 10 Friday. It said trading volume amounted to 104,000 shares.</p>
